From: Ely Office
Subject: LOK: Writer inserts a picture file, the cursor kept

- .uno:ElyInsertImage (Url, After, Width) loads the picture at Url and
  embeds it, anchored as a character, in a new plain paragraph after the
  body's last block, or after the block holding After's first body
  match, in one undo step, without moving any view's cursor or selection.
- The picture keeps its natural size, no wider than the default page
  style's text width; Width (twips) sets the width, the height following.
- A file that is no picture, or no match, leaves the document as it was.

